.TH MCTS 1
.SH NAME
mcts \- Monte Carlo Tree Search runtime
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mcts
[command] [options]
.SH COMMANDS
mcts bench rollouts
mcts bench selfplay
mcts bench terminal\-playouts
mcts bench search\-iters
mcts verify rollouts
mcts verify selfplay
mcts verify legacy\-parity rollouts
mcts verify legacy\-parity selfplay
mcts play
mcts inspect
mcts inspect list
mcts inspect show
mcts inspect replay
mcts inspect cache list
mcts inspect cache prune
mcts inspect divergence
mcts test all
mcts test parity\-anchor
mcts test <stanza>
mcts lint files
mcts lint docs
mcts lint haskell
mcts lint all
mcts docs check
mcts docs generate
mcts commands
mcts help
mcts check\-code
mcts build cpp\-legacy
mcts build cpp\-imperative
mcts build cpp\-functional
mcts build rust
mcts build legacy\-fixtures
.SH COMMON VALUE SETS
.SS Backends
cpp\-legacy ((i) C++ legacy port); cpp\-imperative ((ii) C++ imperative steelman); cpp\-functional ((iii) C++ functional\-core steelman); rust ((iv) Rust steelman); haskell ((v) in\-process Haskell engine)
.SS Q3 verify backends
cpp\-imperative ((ii) C++ imperative steelman); cpp\-functional ((iii) C++ functional\-core steelman); rust ((iv) Rust steelman); haskell ((v) in\-process Haskell engine)
.SS RNG sources
native (backend\-native RNG); cpp (legacy\-compatible C++ RNG)
.SS Sides
hero (the hero side); villain (the villain side)
.SS Threading
single (single\-threaded dispatch); multi (multi\-threaded dispatch using \-\-workers)
.SS Output formats
json (machine\-readable JSON); table (human\-readable table output); plain (plain text output)
.SS Color modes
auto (color when stdout is a terminal); always (always emit ANSI color); never (never emit ANSI color)
